        "nobel_worthiness": "Trapped ions have provided exceptionally clean control of entanglement and computation, making quantum information experimentally concrete.",
        "attribution": "Cirac and Zoller supplied seminal architectures, while Blatt led landmark experimental realization and development.",
        "maturity": "The platform has demonstrated robust quantum operations across many laboratories and remains scientifically productive.",
        "uncertainties": [
